## For every change

1. Find the subject's layer → required cases in [01]({{ref_01}}).
2. Put the test where [02]({{ref_02}}) says, named by behavior.
3. Double only the boundary ([03]({{ref_03}})); reuse existing fixtures.
4. Run the focused command and confirm the new test ran ([05]({{ref_05}})).
5. Bug fix → add the regression test first when practical.

